  "body": "https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/form-control-infrastructure.html#textFieldSelection\r\n\r\n> If the fourth argument's value is \"preserve\"\r\n> If the method has only one argument\r\n\r\nThe case of the method having three arguments is missing here. It is only mentioned in a non-normative paragraph above and the SelectionMode enumeration below.\r\n\r\nThe definition should read something like:\r\n> If the fourth argument's value is \"preserve\" or the default\r\n\r\n",
